                  },
                  "startColumn": 9,
                  "startLine": 38
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "`OpenMarket.market` derives its address with `bump = market_bump`, which comes from the instruction argument `market_bump`. The caller chooses the bump, so they can derive several valid addresses for the same seeds. Use a bare `bump` and let Anchor supply the canonical one."
          },
